                    <p style="color:#aaa;font-size:13px;margin:4px 0;"><i class="fa fa-map-marker" style="color:#e8a020;width:18px;"></i> Toshkent sh., Mustaqillik ko'chasi, 1-uy</p>
                    <p style="color:#aaa;font-size:13px;margin:4px 0;"><i class="fa fa-phone" style="color:#e8a020;width:18px;"></i> <a href="tel:+998712000000" style="color:#aaa;">+99871 200-00-00</a></p>
                    <p style="color:#aaa;font-size:13px;margin:4px 0;"><i class="fa fa-envelope" style="color:#e8a020;width:18px;"></i> <a href="mailto:info@kutubxona.uz" style="color:#aaa;">info@kutubxona.uz</a></p>
